ilst our participants try new exciting material out for the first time!\r\nIf you’re thinking about applying to the course yourself, come and see what it’s all about.\r\n\r\n18+\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":90,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Comedy Plus Lab Sharing","instanceDates":"22 July-22 July","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"486004AQTDRJCLKMHNLHGSPPKLJKQPBRM","firstInstanceDateTime":"2023-07-22T12:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2023-07-22T11:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2023-07-22T12:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2023-07-22T11:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_DynamicPricing":"No","attribute_PriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Venue":"Upstairs","attribute_WebsiteFilterCategory1":"","attribute_WebsiteFilterCategory2":"","attribute_WebsiteFilterCategory3":"","attribute_AudiencePreference1":"","attribute_AudiencePreference2":""},{"description":"Come and see participants of Soho Theatre’s Comedy Plus Lab perform at Soho for one night (well, afternoon) only!\r\n\r\nThey have spent the last 10 weeks honing their comedy material and performance skills with course leader Elf Lyons. Be ready to cheer, scream and dance in your seats whilst our participants try new exciting material out for the first time!\r\nRecent Masterclasses have been led by Duffy and Sikisa.\r\nIf you’re thinking about applying to the course yourself, come and see what it’s all about.\r\n\r\n16+\r\n","htmlDescription":"<div id>\r\n\r\n</div>","duration":90,"imageUrl":"","isOnSale":true,"name":"Comedy Plus Lab Sharing apr23","instanceDates":"1 April-1 April","thumbnailUrl":"","webUrl":"","webEventId":null,"id":"463003AMLJNMKBDCCLBQHQPPNGRHDCQCP","firstInstanceDateTime":"2023-04-01T12:00:00","firstInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2023-04-01T11:00:00Z","lastInstanceDateTime":"2023-04-01T12:00:00","lastInstanceDateTimeUtc":"2023-04-01T11:00:00Z","altText":"","attribute_DynamicPricing":"No","attribute_PriorityBooking":false,"attribute_Venue":"Upstair